					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A tip moving forward, referencing &quot;popular&quot; Series 1 SCPs/basing your entire SCP around them is not a very good idea and doesn't make an article more appealing. To get a better idea of the current meta, so to speak, try checking out some more recent SCPs in Series 5 and 6. Good luck.</p> 
